events.notes:
Together with representatives of the Ministry of Digital Technologies, IT Park Uzbekistan Qashqadaryo branch, telecom operators, and regional organizations, several important priorities were discussed:

🔺expanding IT Park residency opportunities;
🔺creating new jobs through digital technologies;
🔺improving internet and mobile communication quality;
🔺supporting youth interested in modern professions and remote work;
🔺addressing local ICT-related challenges through direct engagement.
